1
00:00:14,443 --> 00:00:17,320
<font color="white">把玲奈小姐还来！</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:17,404 --> 00:00:18,739
<font color="white">来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:01:49,621 --> 00:01:51,039
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:01:59,005 --> 00:02:01,716
<font color="white">你体内潜藏的真正力量</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:05,011
<font color="white">可不只有那点程度</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:02:12,894 --> 00:02:15,188
<font color="white">要让奥特曼失控？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:02:15,272 --> 00:02:20,026
<font color="white">是啊 梅菲斯特指示我们那么做</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:22,195
<font color="white">所以我哥才假冒成奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:02:22,279 --> 00:02:24,739
<font color="white">大肆破坏那场复兴典礼</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:24,823 --> 00:02:27,951
<font color="white">但我可没听说他最后会被杀掉</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:28,034 --> 00:02:31,037
<font color="white">你说那一切都是为了孤立奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:31,121 --> 00:02:33,540
<font color="white">把他逼到走投无路是吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:34,124 --> 00:02:35,792
<font color="white">他那么做有何目的？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:35,876 --> 00:02:37,794
<font color="white">我们哪会知道啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:38,378 --> 00:02:41,965
<font color="white">反正我们也会像这家伙一样</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">被利用完后只能等着被舍弃</font></font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:44,009 --> 00:02:45,093
<font color="white">你要干什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:51,808
<font color="white">原来如此</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:04,779 --> 00:03:07,991
<font color="white">为什么不显现你真正的力量？</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:10,243 --> 00:03:13,163
<font color="white">你拥有的力量应该不只这点程度</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:17,542 --> 00:03:19,920
<font color="white">那我就用这招吧</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:24,049 --> 00:03:24,966
<font color="white">玲奈！</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:27,636 --> 00:03:28,929
<font color="white">这里是…</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:29,971 --> 00:03:31,306
<font color="white">奥特曼？</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:35,352 --> 00:03:38,521
<font color="white">我本来不想做如此不入流之事</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:04:12,973 --> 00:04:14,349
<font color="white">奥特曼？</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:04:44,629 --> 00:04:45,797
<font color="white">（奥特曼与梅菲斯特激战？）</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,174
<font color="white">那就是奥特曼的真实样貌</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:04:48,258 --> 00:04:50,510
<font color="white">既无情又冷酷</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:50,593 --> 00:04:53,555
<font color="white">以残忍手段战斗的那副模样</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:53,638 --> 00:04:57,976
<font color="white">就算说他是毫无人类情感的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">兵器也完全不为过啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:05:15,452 --> 00:05:17,829
<font color="white">正与梅菲斯特交战的奥特曼…</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:05:17,912 --> 00:05:19,748
<font color="white">-怎么会这样？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎么了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:05:20,957 --> 00:05:22,917
<font color="white">装甲内的斯派修姆能量</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:05:23,001 --> 00:05:25,211
<font color="white">正在侵蚀进次郎的身体</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:05:25,795 --> 00:05:26,629
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:05:27,756 --> 00:05:29,090
<font color="white">开始了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:05:31,551 --> 00:05:34,679
<font color="white">那真的能称为正义使者吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:05:35,263 --> 00:05:36,848
<font color="white">我敢断言</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:36,931 --> 00:05:42,062
<font color="white">那只是披着正义英雄的外衣</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">实则浑身沾满鲜血的存在</font></font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:42,645 --> 00:05:45,315
<font color="white">奥特曼本身就是全地球…</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:45,398 --> 00:05:48,443
<font color="white">不 是全宇宙的灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:06:28,942 --> 00:06:30,568
<font color="white">这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:06:31,653 --> 00:06:33,321
<font color="white">既然这样</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:06:33,822 --> 00:06:37,700
<font color="white">我也不得不承认光之巨人的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:06:38,493 --> 00:06:40,829
<font color="white">有多么珍贵的价值了</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:07:09,149 --> 00:07:10,483
<font color="white">奥特曼！</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:07:10,984 --> 00:07:12,694
<font color="white">奥特曼！</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:07:15,155 --> 00:07:17,615
<font color="white">奥特曼！</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:07:31,212 --> 00:07:32,464
<font color="white">爸！</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:07:41,139 --> 00:07:42,474
<font color="white">（紧急事态）</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:07:42,557 --> 00:07:45,143
<font color="white">（奥特曼与梅菲斯特激战？）</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:07:45,768 --> 00:07:48,438
<font color="white">喂 奥特曼在瞄准城市！</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:07:50,398 --> 00:07:51,774
<font color="white">-真的假的？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不要啊！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:08:18,676 --> 00:08:21,304
<font color="white">我一直在等这一刻到来！</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:08:21,387 --> 00:08:23,556
<font color="white">就是这股能量！</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:08:46,496 --> 00:08:47,705
<font color="white">这就是…</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:08:49,249 --> 00:08:51,042
<font color="white">灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:19,988
<font color="white">奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:09:20,071 --> 00:09:21,489
<font color="white">奥特曼！</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:09:39,257 --> 00:09:40,508
<font color="white">进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:09:49,642 --> 00:09:51,060
<font color="white">进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:09:57,233 --> 00:09:58,568
<font color="white">进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:10:02,071 --> 00:10:03,156
<font color="white">进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:10:05,158 --> 00:10:06,284
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:10:08,036 --> 00:10:11,372
<font color="white">玲奈小姐？对不起</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:10:12,373 --> 00:10:16,586
<font color="white">我已经没有力气飞了</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:10:20,381 --> 00:10:21,716
<font color="white">进次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:10:23,509 --> 00:10:25,011
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:10:38,483 --> 00:10:42,111
<font color="white">你很享受青春嘛 学长</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:10:55,958 --> 00:10:58,294
<font color="white">看来你原本也是要被灭口的其中一人</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:10:59,128 --> 00:11:01,547
<font color="white">是你救了我吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:11:02,131 --> 00:11:04,258
<font color="white">毕竟你可是个重要证人</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:11:05,968 --> 00:11:07,470
<font color="white">跟我走一趟</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:11:08,054 --> 00:11:09,347
<font color="white">喂 等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:11:15,103 --> 00:11:16,312
<font color="white">可恶</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:11:29,909 --> 00:11:33,746
<font color="white">这里是哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:11:37,083 --> 00:11:38,042
<font color="white">玲奈小姐！</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:11:44,257 --> 00:11:47,051
<font color="white">-是她救了你一命喔</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-北斗</font></font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:11:48,928 --> 00:11:50,138
<font color="white">你很吃惊吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:11:50,763 --> 00:11:53,141
<font color="white">没想到玲奈小姐会是奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:11:55,351 --> 00:11:58,187
<font color="white">待会要好好跟她道谢才行喔</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:11:58,271 --> 00:12:02,150
<font color="white">当时如果没有她在</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">学长铁定会直直坠落地面</font></font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:12:02,233 --> 00:12:04,152
<font color="white">摔成重伤</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:12:12,368 --> 00:12:13,619
<font color="white">大叔</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:12:14,662 --> 00:12:15,913
<font color="white">你醒了啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:12:19,959 --> 00:12:21,794
<font color="white">他是我爸</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:12:21,878 --> 00:12:23,504
<font color="white">你之前有见过他吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:12:23,588 --> 00:12:24,839
<font color="white">见过</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:12:24,922 --> 00:12:28,634
<font color="white">这就是奥特曼的真实样貌</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:12:28,718 --> 00:12:30,970
<font color="white">就如同我一直以来说的</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:12:31,053 --> 00:12:34,891
<font color="white">如今事实终于证明</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">他们是如灾害般的存在</font></font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:12:35,808 --> 00:12:37,810
<font color="white">他说得好过分啊 对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:12:37,894 --> 00:12:40,813
<font color="white">明明就是因为有学长</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">才能打倒梅菲斯特</font></font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:12:46,944 --> 00:12:48,696
<font color="white">是谁来了？都这么晚了</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:12:53,409 --> 00:12:54,952
<font color="white">什么？你是…</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:13:04,420 --> 00:13:05,463
<font color="white">你是那家伙！</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:13:06,172 --> 00:13:08,966
<font color="white">他是这起事件的重要证人</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:13:09,050 --> 00:13:11,344
<font color="white">-就算你这么说…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那个…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:13:12,094 --> 00:13:14,639
<font color="white">我要为上次的事说声抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:13:15,139 --> 00:13:18,017
<font color="white">我们好像也被那家伙给利用了</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:13:18,100 --> 00:13:19,810
<font color="white">我仍不会原谅你</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:13:25,149 --> 00:13:26,484
<font color="white">所以呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:13:26,567 --> 00:13:27,985
<font color="white">发生什么事了？</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:32,657
<font color="white">我看到了</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:13:34,909 --> 00:13:39,789
<font color="white">我因为愤怒而逐渐</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">无法控制自己的意识与力量</font></font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:13:40,706 --> 00:13:41,958
<font color="white">然后…</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:13:42,875 --> 00:13:46,087
<font color="white">当下你觉得自己就快要</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">变成光之巨人了对吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:13:46,587 --> 00:13:48,256
<font color="white">你怎么会知道那件事？</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:13:48,339 --> 00:13:49,715
<font color="white">因为这可是</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:13:49,799 --> 00:13:53,135
<font color="white">贝姆拉本人最担心的事情啊</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:13:53,719 --> 00:13:54,929
<font color="white">你说贝姆拉？</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:13:55,012 --> 00:13:55,888
<font color="white">现在的状况</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:13:55,972 --> 00:14:00,977
<font color="white">正朝他最忧心的最糟结果发展</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:14:01,477 --> 00:14:04,146
<font color="white">但是他却失踪了</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:14:04,730 --> 00:14:08,317
<font color="white">我们都击败了梅菲斯特</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">还有什么好担心的？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:14:08,401 --> 00:14:11,612
<font color="white">就算没有他 计划还是照样在运行</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:14:12,822 --> 00:14:13,698
<font color="white">看看这个吧</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:14:13,781 --> 00:14:15,074
{\an8}<font color="white">（紧急事态）</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:14:15,157 --> 00:14:16,284
{\an8}<font color="white">各位请看</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:14:16,367 --> 00:14:19,704
{\an8}<font color="white">梅菲斯特的宇宙飞船内</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">似乎发出了神秘的光芒</font></font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:14:19,787 --> 00:14:21,163
<font color="white">-那是什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-根据专家表示…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:14:21,247 --> 00:14:23,332
<font color="white">就说了我什么都不知道啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:14:23,416 --> 00:14:26,085
{\an8}<font color="white">那是亚空间门</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:14:26,168 --> 00:14:28,004
{\an8}<font color="white">这到底是要做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:14:28,087 --> 00:14:31,173
{\an8}<font color="white">有人打算召唤出某种巨大的东西</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:14:32,008 --> 00:14:35,136
<font color="white">斯派修姆光线的力量</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">这下反被他们给利用了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:14:36,012 --> 00:14:37,388
<font color="white">也就是说</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:14:37,471 --> 00:14:41,309
<font color="white">梅菲斯特其实并不是敌方的主谋吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:14:43,477 --> 00:14:45,271
<font color="white">奉劝你不要插手</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:14:45,938 --> 00:14:48,733
<font color="white">科学特搜队的人都被公安监禁了</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:14:49,483 --> 00:14:51,402
<font color="white">联络我的杰克是这么说的</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:14:52,612 --> 00:14:55,656
<font color="white">要是你傻傻回去 当心有同样的下场</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:14:57,033 --> 00:15:00,077
<font color="white">虽然凭你们的力量</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">要对付公安简直易如反掌</font></font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:15:00,995 --> 00:15:02,538
<font color="white">但现在的情况不适合</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:15:03,289 --> 00:15:06,459
<font color="white">意思就是说现在静观其变才是上策啦</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:15:07,126 --> 00:15:09,003
<font color="white">学长也那么觉得吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:15:13,966 --> 00:15:17,637
<font color="white">看你的表情 似乎是不能再战了</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:15:20,890 --> 00:15:22,183
<font color="white">我很害怕</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:15:26,479 --> 00:15:30,399
<font color="white">我怕无法控制自己的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:15:34,278 --> 00:15:37,990
<font color="white">未来会有多少人会</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因此受伤 甚至丧命？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:41,869
<font color="white">而且…</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:15:43,537 --> 00:15:45,790
<font color="white">下次我要是再失控</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:15:46,999 --> 00:15:48,960
<font color="white">我可能就再也回不来…</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:15:49,043 --> 00:15:51,379
<font color="white">“我还是不想要任何人受害</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:15:52,004 --> 00:15:56,676
<font color="white">不造成任何伤亡 拯救所有人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我想成为的是这样的奥特曼”</font></font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:15:59,095 --> 00:16:03,099
<font color="white">以前我听某个天真小子那么说过</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:16:03,975 --> 00:16:04,976
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:08,938
<font color="white">我竟然蠢到把那些话当真</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:16:11,107 --> 00:16:12,483
<font color="white">真让人不爽</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:16:13,818 --> 00:16:15,736
<font color="white">什么？喂！</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:18,030
<font color="white">你们就照顾他一阵子吧</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:16:18,739 --> 00:16:19,782
<font color="white">我吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:16:19,865 --> 00:16:22,868
<font color="white">虽然不能保证安全</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">但总好过放他在外乱跑吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:16:23,452 --> 00:16:24,286
<font color="white">对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:16:26,789 --> 00:16:29,291
<font color="white">喂 你真的要答应？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:16:36,048 --> 00:16:38,884
<font color="white">真是的 怎么每个人都那么任性？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:16:41,137 --> 00:16:42,179
<font color="white">学长？</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:16:46,559 --> 00:16:48,227
<font color="white">请好照顾玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:16:51,772 --> 00:16:53,190
<font color="white">真是拿你没办法</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:16:55,109 --> 00:16:57,194
<font color="white">谢谢你 北斗</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:17:07,621 --> 00:17:09,999
<font color="white">让他走真的好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:15,004
<font color="white">反正我也阻止不了</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:17:16,088 --> 00:17:18,716
<font color="white">结果还是只能演变成这样吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:17:18,799 --> 00:17:20,217
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:17:20,801 --> 00:17:23,471
<font color="white">说得好像你还有其他方法</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:17:24,096 --> 00:17:27,141
<font color="white">那就是我回来的理由啊</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,937
<font color="white">不过看那情况…</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:17:34,899 --> 00:17:36,025
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:17:37,943 --> 00:17:39,195
<font color="white">我也要去</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:17:39,862 --> 00:17:42,698
<font color="white">只要是我现在能做到的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">都请让我协助</font></font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:17:43,532 --> 00:17:46,452
<font color="white">-随你高兴</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好的</font></font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:17:49,246 --> 00:17:51,332
<font color="white">所以我们要去哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:17:51,415 --> 00:17:52,750
<font color="white">那还用说？</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:18:03,219 --> 00:18:04,428
<font color="white">这是不可能的</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:18:04,512 --> 00:18:08,015
<font color="white">而且回科学特搜队是打算要做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:18:08,641 --> 00:18:10,810
<font color="white">我想要调查一些事情</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:18:10,893 --> 00:18:15,064
<font color="white">但问题是该如何穿过那层戒备</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:18:15,147 --> 00:18:17,733
<font color="white">那种事情就交给我吧</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:18:18,234 --> 00:18:20,694
<font color="white">你在这里做什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我不是叫你待在那边吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:18:20,778 --> 00:18:24,323
<font color="white">我欠了人情不还 会浑身不舒服</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:18:27,284 --> 00:18:29,286
<font color="white">我应该帮得上忙喔</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:18:30,871 --> 00:18:31,997
<font color="white">我懂了</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:18:36,919 --> 00:18:38,003
<font color="white">站住！</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:18:39,004 --> 00:18:42,341
<font color="white">-我叫你站住！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-大家好 晚安啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:18:44,885 --> 00:18:45,970
<font color="white">这家伙…</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:18:48,347 --> 00:18:50,057
<font color="white">喂！开火！</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:18:56,689 --> 00:18:58,357
<font color="white">快追上去！</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:18:58,440 --> 00:19:00,192
<font color="white">奥特曼出现了</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:19:00,276 --> 00:19:01,902
<font color="white">所有队员立刻集中至正门！</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:19:26,844 --> 00:19:28,929
<font color="white">跟岚先生给的情报一样</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:19:38,105 --> 00:19:39,899
<font color="white">要找其他路径吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:19:47,323 --> 00:19:48,365
<font color="white">回来得真快啊</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:19:48,949 --> 00:19:51,285
<font color="white">因为外头的骚动 班表有变</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:19:51,368 --> 00:19:52,745
<font color="white">换人看守了</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:19:53,746 --> 00:19:54,914
<font color="white">了解</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:20:14,975 --> 00:20:17,353
<font color="white">-星山</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:20:17,436 --> 00:20:19,063
<font color="white">是我</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:20:19,146 --> 00:20:20,481
<font color="white">诸星先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:20:23,692 --> 00:20:27,404
<font color="white">我们这边真的大事不妙</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">井手先生和光太郎先生都被监禁</font></font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:20:27,488 --> 00:20:29,448
<font color="white">我知道 你先冷静</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:20:30,950 --> 00:20:33,619
<font color="white">把奥特曼过去的战斗资料调出来</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:20:35,204 --> 00:20:36,247
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:20:38,707 --> 00:20:41,460
<font color="white">你能调出这份资料的读取记录吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:20:41,543 --> 00:20:42,628
<font color="white">可以</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:20:45,297 --> 00:20:46,882
<font color="white">我就知道</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:20:46,966 --> 00:20:48,759
<font color="white">这里有某人避开信息防护机制</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:20:48,842 --> 00:20:51,720
<font color="white">把资料传送到外部的痕迹</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:54,556
<font color="white">请等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:57,559
<font color="white">这是我测试装甲的数据</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:20:57,643 --> 00:20:58,936
<font color="white">进次郎？</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:20:59,728 --> 00:21:01,563
<font color="white">竟然连这种数据也…</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:21:01,647 --> 00:21:06,235
<font color="white">正好就是这时候</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">在你身上发现失控的征兆</font></font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:21:06,735 --> 00:21:09,655
<font color="white">一年前和佩丹星人交战时的数据也是</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:21:10,239 --> 00:21:13,242
<font color="white">难道说他们在那时候</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:21:13,325 --> 00:21:15,244
<font color="white">就分析斯派修姆光线的能量了？</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:21:15,327 --> 00:21:16,704
<font color="white">-奇怪？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎么了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:21:17,288 --> 00:21:23,168
<font color="white">奥特曼装甲的定位信息外流了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">连测试用装甲也是同样的状况</font></font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:21:24,044 --> 00:21:26,630
<font color="white">能做到那种事情的…</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:21:26,714 --> 00:21:27,965
<font color="white">是井手先生吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:21:28,924 --> 00:21:30,092
<font color="white">不对</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:21:32,970 --> 00:21:38,392
<font color="white">那时还有另一个人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">没有阻止我使用测试装甲</font></font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:21:41,854 --> 00:21:43,105
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:21:44,023 --> 00:21:45,733
<font color="white">有东西正在接近！</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:22:01,665 --> 00:22:03,292
<font color="white">这才是他们的目的啊</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:22:05,294 --> 00:22:07,838
<font color="white">你们终于来了</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:22:10,299 --> 00:22:11,592
<font color="white">伊多先生！</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:22:12,092 --> 00:22:14,219
<font color="white">这景象不赖吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:22:15,387 --> 00:22:16,805
<font color="white">诸星</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:22:17,306 --> 00:22:18,891
<font color="white">还有…</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:22:23,771 --> 00:22:26,148
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻译：蒋文昊</font><font color="white"></font>

